WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.930
I'm Hoshizora Miyuki!

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.160
On my first day at my new school, I met Candy

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.370
and became a Precure!

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.470
Akane-chan is Cure Sunny, the second Precure.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:15.040
My classmate Yayoi-chan transforms into Cure Peace,

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.580
so now there are three of us!

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.680
But I hear there are five Precure all together.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.950
Let's find the fourth Precure!

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.400
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.240
Smile Precure!

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.140
Let's go!

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:32.670
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.810
All together!

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.410
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.610
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.280
Smile Precure!

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:45.120
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:50.560
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:55.760
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:01.700
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:06.640
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:06.610
So bright!

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:11.810
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:18.250
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.750
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:19.920
Let's go!

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.620
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.560
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:30.360
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:30.930
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.600
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:33.730
Everybody!

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:35.400
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.940
Fly to the future!

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:41.440
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.610
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:45.910
Smile Precure!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.970
What great weather!

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:55.130
Looks like it's going to be another ultra happy day!

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.400
I want to be stylish, too-kuru!

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:02.470
Make my ears cute with the rabbit Décor-kuru.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:03.710
With a Décor?

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.710
Let's go! Rabbit!

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:10.420
What a cute brush!

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.410
Candy, your <i>ears!</i>

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:17.590
Make them like rabbit ears-kuru!

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:19.190
I see!

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:20.290
Okay!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.320
Rabbit-san-style!

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:27.330
Finished!

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.140
It's cute-kuru!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:32.040
I'm ultra happy it turned out well!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.370
This late already?

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:38.040
I'm running late!

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.100
How nice and damp-oni!

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.970
Newly washed undies are so refreshing-oni!

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.940
It's another day of work to be done-oni!

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.210
Yayoi, is that lunch of yours…

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.580
…Candy?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:15.980
Candy-kuru!

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.560
I thought I'd try making one.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.050
You made it yourself?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.560
Amazing-kuru!

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.570
Taste test! Taste test!

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.160
Don't eat me-kuru!

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:28.660
It tastes fantastic!

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.330
Really?

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.230
I want to eat some too-kuru!

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.730
Me too!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.560
Go ahead!

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.810
Hey, you.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.250
Sorry, but can't you sit somewhere else?

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.270
This is our spot.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.970
We always eat here.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.550
What? The early bird gets the worm, right?

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.490
We <i>always</i> use this spot.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:51.450
You guys are eighth graders, right?

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:52.460
What's that?

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.900
What's this got to with being an eighth grader or ninth grader?

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.890
Whatever! Out of the way!

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.390
You two!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.610
Midorikawa-san!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.500
Even if you're older,

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.130
kicking people out when they got in first

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.040
just isn't right.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.240
“Kicking people out”?!

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.330
The courtyard belongs to everyone.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.440
What you're saying to these girls

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.210
is a little unreasonable, I think.

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:23.950
<i>She's brave, and cool, too!</i>

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.120
Kuru! Kuru!

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:26.820
You—

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:27.820
That's right!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.010
Student Council President Irie!

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:32.020
It's just as she said.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.990
This place belongs to all students.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:36.190
Right?

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.320
Y-You're right!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.200
We were wrong.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.060
I'm sorry.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:42.700
Not at all!

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:44.280
See you later!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.640
Are you eating lunch in the courtyard, too?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.110
No, I'm on patrol for Clean School Grounds Week.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.400
Thanks, Midorikawa-san!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.450
You saved us!

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.950
I was just stating the obvious.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.790
Well, I've got some training to do, so I'll be off.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.790
Nice!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.890
That's it!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:08.620
See you later!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.360
Bye!

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:09.900
Later!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:12.600
Over here!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:13.970
Over here!

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:16.970
So cool!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.140
Go for it!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.410
Go for it!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:23.740
She's fast!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:28.580
Nao-chan has been a regular on the team since seventh grade.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:31.970
They say she can break through any opposition.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.620
Not bad, is she?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.700
So cool!

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:46.990
I think Midorikawa-san would make a great fourth Precure.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:50.000
Nope! No one else will do!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.100
You're right!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.370
I think so, too!

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.870
I think Nao-chan would make a tough Precure.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.800
Kuru!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.180
That's it for today!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.310
We did it!

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.280
Great work!

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.980
Alright, now we make our move!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.050
Midorikawa-senpai!

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.720
Great work!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.520
Thank you!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.410
They beat us to her!

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:12.730
Midorikawa-san!

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:16.190
I want you to be a Precure with us!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.400
Don't say that in front of everyone-kuru!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.450
Oh, that's right!

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:22.370
Huh?

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:24.270
Where's Nao?

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.210
She's gone home already.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.780
Oh, I just want Midorikawa-san to be the fourth Precure!

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.980
But there's no school tomorrow…

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.020
That's it!

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.420
It's another sunny day!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.630
I'll go visit her!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:50.530
Wait…

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.080
Where…

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:52.880
…am I?

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.500
You don't know-kuru?!

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:57.800
I only just moved here, you know!

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.070
What can I do?

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:01.230
I'm lost!

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.170
Hoshizora-san?

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.110
It <i>is</i> you!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.890
You live around here?

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:08.820
Mi…

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:09.820
<i>Mi…</i>

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.220
<i>Midorikawa-san!</i>

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:16.010
Is this fate? I'm ultra happy! Thank you!

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:17.620
What? What's is it?

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:19.830
So heavy…

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.810
Are you really alright?

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:23.770
Yeah, let me help you!

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:24.850
Thanks!

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:26.320
My house is right there!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.630
Um… you know what?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.720
I came to talk to you about something, you see.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:31.470
Talk?

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:34.660
You see, Akane-chan, Yayoi-chan and I have this thing.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:36.180
We're Precure—

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.040
Big Sis Nao! Welcome home!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:38.770
I'm home!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.150
Okay, stand in line!

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:42.380
From the top: Keita…

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.420
Haru…

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.300
Hina…

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.420
Yuuta…

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.320
Kouta!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.490
Hello!

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:49.490
Whoa!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.900
H-Hello!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.790
This is Big Sis's friend: Hoshizora Miyuki-chan.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.520
Miyuki-oneechan!

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:57.930
Alright, grab the bags.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:07:59.270
Okay!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.620
Thanks, Hoshizora-san!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.140
Why don't you stay for lunch?

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.110
Can I?!

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:10.290
Amazing!

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.500
You make the meals!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:16.680
Mom and Dad are out at a neighborhood association meeting.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.480
Miss, let's play!

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:20.560
Over here! Over here!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.590
Hey, now!

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:22.590
It's fine! It's fine!

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:26.000
I love playing with kids!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.290
Let's go!

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:28.990
What'll we play?

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:32.260
Tag! Let's play tag!

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:33.650
Alright, I'm It!{TL: the word "oni" has a lot of different meanings, and a lot of them get used in this dialogue. I'm just hoping to make this TL make sense, and I'll explain what's actually going on in our release post}

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:34.900
Me too!

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.300
It!

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:36.740
I'll be It, too!

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.200
You're <i>all</i> It?

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:41.440
Which means…

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:43.180
After her!

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.290
A raccoon dog!

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.160
I'm not a raccoon dog-kuru!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.860
Miss!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.390
<i>Pom Poko!</i>

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:03.930
Kuru!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:04.910
Candy!?

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.830
Save me-kuru!

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.300
Hey! Pass! Pass!

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:11.200
<i>Super-ultra-attack!</i>

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:15.640
Candy!

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:18.610
You can't handle this alone-kuru!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.130
I'll go get Akane and Yayoi-kuru…

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.420
Thanks!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:25.620
Okay, now it's her turn!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:28.020
Alright! Here I co—

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.170
Go “Roar!” when you're hit!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.260
I'm a <i>monster?</i>

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.390
Attack her!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.140
Hey!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.930
Play nice, will you?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.230
It's another monster!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.070
A monster!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:46.850
Someone called-oni?

00:09:47.240 --> 00:09:48.810
Never mind.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:54.980
Time to suck the Bad Energy from those humans again!

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.690
March!

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:07.890
Candy!

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:10.850
Let's go!

00:10:10.850 --> 00:10:12.250
Hoshizora-san,

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.490
thanks for helping me clean up.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:16.720
No, thank <i>you!</i>

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:19.400
That lunch was <i>delicious.</i>

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:22.150
You're pretty impressive, Midorikawa-san,

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.270
looking after your siblings like that.

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.260
That's only natural!

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:27.870
I'm their big sister, aren't I?

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:32.110
Besides, I have a lot of fun around them.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:35.580
I love my family.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:40.590
She's courageous, cool, kind…

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:42.620
Yep, that's it!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:46.330
Hey, you know, there's something I want us to do together.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.490
Hey!

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.660
Sorry we're late!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.380
Akane? Yayoi-chan?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.370
Sorry about the wait.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:54.630
I called them.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.840
I figured it'd be more ultra happy if we all hung out together.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:01.680
Thanks!

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.480
It's the okonomiyaki girl!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.490
We'll show you how strong our family bonds are!

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.790
Our teamwork is unbeatable!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.560
“Bonds”?

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.530
Pathetic-oni!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.630
The world!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:29.170
May you be stained with the worst possible ending: a Bad End-oni!

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:32.410
I'll blot out the pages where your future will be written-oni!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:38.680
What's going on?

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:43.050
This is no fun.

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.750
I'm going home.

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.010
My family…

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.720
It'll just split up one day…

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.260
The Bad Energy from these humans

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:55.620
is bringing back our lord Pierrot-sama,

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:58.260
the Emperor of Evil-oni!

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.800
Midorikawa-san!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.700
Any good kids 'round 'ere?{TL: there's a cultural reference here that I'll explain on the site. I'm hoping that it makes enough sense in English for a troll-like creature to say something like this, but suggestions are welcome, as usual.}

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.630
It's Akaoni-san again!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:08.860
Shouldn't it be more like,

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:10.680
“Any crybabies 'round 'ere?”

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:13.610
Guys!

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:16.050
Turn into Precure and fight-kuru!

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.920
I might be too scared for this!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:19.980
It's alright!

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:22.660
We've got one another!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:23.530
That's right!

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:24.390
Let's go!

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.990
Ready?

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.320
Precure Smile Charge!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.250
Go!

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.140
Go! Go!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.470
Let's go!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:33.590
The light of the future,

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:35.530
shining bright!

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:38.730
Cure Happy!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.670
Dazzling sun!

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:48.510
Hot-blooded power!

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:51.180
Cure Sunny!

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.670
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:03.930
Cure Peace!

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:09.430
“Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...”?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:11.170
It was scissors last time-oni!{TL: spot the troll in this picture.}

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:12.900
This time it's <i>paper-oni?</i>

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:15.130
I lost at rock, paper, scissors-oni!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:16.670
What's that all about?

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:19.210
Today's twinkling rock, paper, scissors hand is paper!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:20.340
That sounds like fun!

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.040
I chose scissors! I win-kuru!

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.710
How is <i>that</i> scissors?

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.170
Call that fun-oni?

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:38.890
Akanbe!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.430
No!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.370
<i>Spirit!</i>

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:54.750
Precure…

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.560
…Happy…

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.550
<i>…Shower!</i>

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:08.650
She did it!

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.400
Happy!

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:26.650
Fools-oni!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:28.210
Sunny! Peace!

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:32.680
Forget about the others and run for your lives-oni!

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.180
I don't think so!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:36.690
The bonds that hold us together

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:38.980
aren't really that tight yet…

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:41.740
… but they will be!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:43.370
No way are we running!

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.160
That's right!

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.560
Sunny! Peace!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.260
Bonds…?

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.200
Midorikawa-san!

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:55.700
Hoshizora-san?

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:57.240
What's going on?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.570
Sorry, Midorikawa-san!

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.940
I can't tell you if I'm Hoshizora-san or not!

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.400
And <i>that</i> let the cat out of the bag!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:09.010
Akane? Yayoi-chan?

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:10.750
What's this about “bonds”-oni?

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:13.420
Friendship?

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:14.620
Family?

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:19.160
All that will just break up in the end-oni!

00:16:20.320 --> 00:16:23.860
In fact, I'll smash you up now, myself-oni!

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.870
Akanbe! Get them-oni!

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.300
Akanbe!

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:33.890
Akane! Yayoi-chan!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.880
Akanbe!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:42.550
<i>Stop!</i>

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.490
Akan—

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:51.120
Kuru?!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.700
Midorikawa-san?

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:02.170
My family won't be breaking up!

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.340
The bonds holding my family together

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.310
will stay strong forever!

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.270
Kuru!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.240
Nao-chan!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.910
Who do you think you are?

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:12.810
Get her, Akanbe!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:16.120
I don't know who the hell you guys are,

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.090
but if you think you're going to split my family up,

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.460
you'll have to fight <i>me</i> first!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.590
Akan—

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:29.820
Midorikawa-san?

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.570
You're the fourth Precure-kuru!

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:36.980
“Precure”?

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:39.510
Wait, the raccoon dog plushie talked?

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:40.770
Who are you calling a raccoon dog-kuru?

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:44.220
What's this?

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.840
A Smile Pact-kuru!

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:47.410
Put a Cure Décor into the Smile Pact,

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.620
and cry “Precure Smile Charge”-kuru!

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.390
I don't really understand…{TL: wait for it…}

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.820
…but I'll give it a shot!{TL: =_=}{Timer:\(^_^)/}{Editor: I'm not complaing about my job being easier}{QC: We'll do this again next week. XD}

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:01.330
Ready?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:04.120
Precure Smile Charge!

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:05.210
Go!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.990
Go! Go!

00:18:07.990 --> 00:18:09.870
Let's go, March!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.830
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.000
Cure March!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.540
What's this?

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.170
What happened?

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:49.240
“Cure March”…?

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:50.880
Cure March!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:53.680
So you <i>are</i> the fourth Precure!

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.750
We've found a Precure-kuru!

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.220
She's so cool!

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.180
Not like “rock, paper, scissors”, eh?

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:01.720
That line is cute!

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:04.190
Not <i>another</i> new Precure?

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:05.660
Akanbe!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.160
<i>Akanbe!</i>

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.080
I'll do everything I can

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.300
to keep my family together!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:17.980
What?

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:19.440
How am I running so fast?

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.010
Akanbe!

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.440
Wait up!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.850
Are… Are you alright?

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.130
That was a shock!{TL: this line always seems to be a pain to TL naturally}

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:41.190
She's tough!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.070
Whoa! What power!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:55.940
Amazing!

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:56.910
Awesome!

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.680
Cleanse the Akanbe with the March Shoot-kuru!

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.010
“March Shoot”?

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.730
Put your power into the Smile Pact-kuru!

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.650
You mean this?

00:20:05.650 --> 00:20:06.050
Yes!

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:07.590
Power? Like this?

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:08.420
Yes!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.090
What the?

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:12.190
It's sucking up power!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.790
Don't stop-kuru!

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.660
Put more power into it-kuru!

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.130
Got it!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.800
Akanbe! What are you doing-oni?

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:23.740
Now-oni!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:26.640
Akanbe!

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:34.680
Precure…

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:38.480
…March Shoot!

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:48.130
Akanbe!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.470
We did it!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:57.960
What the?

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.940
It's like that drained all the power out of me.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.140
Falling on my butt got my undies dirty-oni!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.110
Precure!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:07.810
I'll remember this!

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:16.190
It's a butterfly Décor-kuru!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.450
Um, Midorikawa-san…

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.570
Just call me Nao.

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.570
Nao-chan, please join our—

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:30.900
Miyuki-chan,

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:33.510
I reckon we'd make a great team.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:36.980
Thanks for saving my family.

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:39.940
I want to help everyone, too.

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.180
Besides,

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:43.910
doing things together is kind of fun!

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:45.320
Can I join you?

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:51.020
Of course!

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:52.260
Thank goodness-kuru!

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:54.060
It's the fourth Precure-kuru!

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:55.530
Watch out!

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:00.860
Miyuki-chan!

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.000
I'm ultra happy that our team has grown bigger!

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:48.330
There's one more Precure left! Aoki-san! Please become a Precure with us!

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:50.680
Precure? What is that?

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:52.380
Beautiful and kind, Aoki-san would be great!

00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:54.380
It fits her image perfectly ~kuru!

00:23:54.390 --> 00:23:59.130
I'm sorry, but I must refuse. There is something I must do.

00:23:59.150 --> 00:24:01.780
Eh!? No way...

00:24:02.780 --> 00:24:04.480
Smile Precure!

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:09.980
Find your ultra happy smile!
